  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "What is the exact rule linking jets allocated to training in a given year to the number of pilots trained that year — for example, does each training jet train exactly one pilot per year, or is there a different rate or a fixed number of pilots per training jet?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single specific rule or rate linking training jets to pilots trained. Although it provides examples, it seeks one policy definition."
}

